  "details": "I would like to see a portion of the profits from external asset store sales shared with VRChat.\n\nSince creating content is a major part of the enjoyment in VRChat, assets from outside the platform play a significant role, and honestly, trying to handle everything through in-game transactions alone feels like a mismatch.\n\nIdeally, it would be best if profits from external asset sales could be returned to VRChat. (I understand it may be difficult to achieve, especially since this would require integration with platforms like Booth or Gumroad...)\n\n外部アセットストアでの販売利益がVRChatに分配されてほしい。\n\nVRCはCreateすることが大きな楽しみの一角を占めているサービスなので、その外側のアセットが大きな意味を持っていて、VRC内決済だけでどうにかするのは正直ミスマッチ。\n\n外部アセット利益還元が実現できれば最も理想的だと思う。（BoothやGumroadと連携すると言う話なので実現性としては難しいと思うが……）",
